# Line endings are load-bearing here: the golden tests hash chunked fixture
# text, and possession binding hashes raw corpus bytes — a CRLF checkout would
# silently change both. Everything is committed and checked out as LF, and the
# fixtures plus vendored assets are never converted at all.
* text=auto eol=lf
tests/fixtures/** -text
app/static/vendor/** -text
*.png binary
*.npy binary
